<title>USA: MEAG to sell $195 mln bond deal next week.</title>
<headline>MEAG to sell $195 mln bond deal next week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Municipal Electric Authority of Georgia said Tuesday it plans to sell $195 million bonds next week.</p>
<p>The senior manager for the issue is JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
